{'symbol': 'AMP', 'date': '2022-07-20 09:00:00', 'title': 'AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL NAMED “BEST PLACE TO WORK” ON THE DISABILITY EQUALITY INDEX® FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TODAY, AMERIPRISE FINANCIAL, INC. (NYSE:AMP) ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED A “BEST PLACE TO WORK FOR DISABILITY INCLUSION” BY THE AMERICAN ASSOCIATION OF PEOPLE WITH DISABILITIES AND DISABILITY:IN FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR. AMERIPRISE EARNED THIS DISTINCTION AS A RESULT OF RECEIVING A SCORE OF 90 PERCENT ON THE DISABILITY EQUALITY INDEX® (DEI), WHICH IS REGARDED AS THE MOST COMPREHENSIVE BENCHMARKING TOOL FOR DISABILITY INCLUSION IN THE WORKPLACE. “AT AMERIPRISE'}